    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1175770/extras/63ace02c06616ecdfe944a6d902bbe3e.avif?t=1742856752\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Easy to pick up and play, with infinite depth to master.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TopplePOP</strong> is physics puzzle action!\u00a0 1-4 players guide bendy animal acrobats on rubber bands in a race to rescue their pals.\u00a0 Various game modes for spectacular couch co-op parties, solo speedruns, eSports tournaments and weekly challenge leaderboards.\u00a0 Style your unique bungee blockbuster and\u00a0<i><strong>become champions!\u00a0 Or not</strong>!\u00a0\u00a0</i>And chill exploring an infinite variety of zen puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>- <i>100% </i>\ud83d\udc96<i>Steam Deck Compatible! -</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take your puzzle gaming\u00a0<strong><i>&quot;off the grid&quot;</i></strong><i> for fast &amp; fluid freestyle physics fun!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>  </strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 1 - 4 Players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use Keys, Keys + Mouse or Controller (recommended)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solo / Co-op Story Campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PvE against AI opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">local multiplayer,\u00a0 online multiplayer\u00a0 or  both at once!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Casual Parties and Spectacular eSports Tournaments!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PvP - 1v1,\u00a0 2v2 Teams,\u00a0 3 to 4 Player free-for-all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Daily &amp; Weekly Leaderboard Challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>( * local multiplayer requires at least 1 controller )</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1175770/extras/017df9995c0189419b4f707b23c30fc1.poster.avif?t=1742856752\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1175770/extras/017df9995c0189419b4f707b23c30fc1.webm?t=1742856752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><i><strong>  </strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1175770/extras/9ae5ffe136984d29184a3ea9dfdb26cf.avif?t=1742856752\" /></div><i><strong><strong><i>Guide bendy animal acrobats on rubber bands with gamepads (recommended) or keyboard / keys &amp; mouse.</i></strong></strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong><strong><i><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1175770/extras/64a33b1c48bdb6e83feeed6c091036fd.poster.avif?t=1742856752\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1175770/extras/64a33b1c48bdb6e83feeed6c091036fd.webm?t=1742856752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></i></strong></strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1175770/extras/c129671fb2c9c88aa64402f94558b56e.avif?t=1742856752\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong><strong><i>Swing, fling, rotate, shove, stack and topple colorful blocks! Connect 4 to combo and POP! Chain combos to topple your opponents!</i></strong></strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong><strong><i><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cla